# Pier 7's first block (the north-west one; its long north-west side meets the plaza's ramp, its
# south-east side the steps toward the second block): crossing toward its south-east long edge at 25
# degrees from the street level at 5 m/s, an ollie and grind pressed in the air catch the long edge (not
# the street end): a 50-50 toward the bay to the end, off it onto the seawall level, landed.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport 563.19 929.35 -9.25 29.5
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x 2.465
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y 4.350
hold ollie 78..90
tap grind 102..126 every 4
bot balance
run 330
expect event grindStart{trick=BS 50-50,line=ledge_564_933} within 101..105
expect event grindEnd{reason=end} within 196..204
expect event gap{id=pier7_bench,gap=PIER 7 BLOCK,points=250} within 196..204
expect event land{quality=clean} within 240..248
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50 + PIER 7 BLOCK} within 251..259
expect no event bail
expect no event wallrideStart
